You get a grill in your
stove top, oven top, sorry.

01:46:25.992 --> 01:46:28.297
Oven top, and you get this grill for fish

01:46:28.297 --> 01:46:29.490
and it's like this wide.

01:46:29.490 --> 01:46:30.323
- Yeah, you have to

01:46:30.323 --> 01:46:31.156
pull it out.
- It can literally fit

01:46:31.156 --> 01:46:32.139
