01:46:37.590 --> 01:46:38.517
He's like, I want a roast,

01:46:38.517 --> 01:46:39.985
How are we gonna have a roast, Garnt?

01:46:39.985 --> 01:46:41.636
Explain the logistics behind this.

01:46:41.636 --> 01:46:43.764
The logistics, Garnt,
I'm bringing it back.

01:46:43.764 --> 01:46:45.778
- Now I have an oven and I think you-

