01:46:53.258 --> 01:46:54.857
(laughing)

01:46:54.857 --> 01:46:56.814
Connor, you're so lazy,
why do you eat out?

01:46:56.814 --> 01:46:58.415
Sometimes, I meal prep,

01:46:58.415 --> 01:47:00.778
meal prep, this sounds so fucking lame.

01:47:00.778 --> 01:47:01.611
I meal prep, bro.

01:47:01.611 --> 01:47:04.505
I'll make a curry for five days

01:47:04.505 --> 01:47:08.004
and I'll eat the curry over
five days, like a Thai curry.

01:47:08.004 --> 01:47:09.567
That's about it, that's as
far as cooking goes for me.

01:47:09.567 --> 01:47:11.636
