I'm pretty sure we touched

01:47:11.636 --> 01:47:12.983
upon this on a previous episode,

01:47:12.983 --> 01:47:14.130
- But people got so pissed when we said.

01:47:14.130 --> 01:47:15.693
That they were like, "It's
not cheaper to eat out

01:47:15.693 --> 01:47:17.195
if you do X and X and X."

01:47:17.195 --> 01:47:18.916
And it's, yeah, if I ate pasta and sauce,

01:47:18.916 --> 01:47:20.335
of course it's gonna be cheaper.

01:47:20.335 --> 01:47:22.303
But if you want to have
something that tastes different,

01:47:22.303 --> 01:47:24.805
yes, it's gonna maybe be a 100-

01:47:24.805 --> 01:47:27.734
- If you want a different
meal every day, yeah, exactly.

01:47:27.734 --> 01:47:29.545
- And you can't be fucked
to go shopping every day

01:47:29.545 --> 01:47:32.854
