01:48:02.710 --> 01:48:05.091
And I'm talking more than any one person

01:48:05.091 --> 01:48:06.171
could ever use in a week.

01:48:06.171 --> 01:48:07.213
- It's like that big.

01:48:07.213 --> 01:48:10.322
- It's like a tub this thick
just filled with these cuts,

01:48:10.322 --> 01:48:11.628
and it's like, I'm not gonna use this.

01:48:11.628 --> 01:48:13.790
I feel bad 'cause I throw
all the ingredients away

01:48:13.790 --> 01:48:14.632
'cause I can't use them.

01:48:14.632 --> 01:48:16.887
- Well, it's because cut shallots are used

01:48:16.887 --> 01:48:19.149
