always come in packs of six.

01:48:22.700 --> 01:48:25.040
Tomatoes are fucking big!

01:48:25.040 --> 01:48:26.941
I don't need six most of the time.

01:48:26.941 --> 01:48:30.339
And 'cause of how we do,
say we record on Tuesdays,

01:48:30.339 --> 01:48:31.974
we're gonna eat out,
and then maybe on Monday

01:48:31.974 --> 01:48:33.921
